 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "records is a list of [plate, checkpoint] pairs in the order the passes happened. A checkpoint name is upper-case letters followed by a decimal number; its position is that number. Each vehicle pays, for every two consecutive passes of that vehicle, 10 times the absolute difference of the two positions; a vehicle with one pass pays 0. Return [plate, total fee] for every plate that appears, sorted by plate in ascending character order.",
